00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:09.680
Forseti's really cool.

00:03:09.680 --> 00:03:14.120
It's an open-source tool that
enables you to basically do

00:03:14.120 --> 00:03:16.640
several things over your
Google Cloud Platform project.

00:03:16.640 --> 00:03:19.430
Basically, if you think
about it in terms of--

00:03:19.430 --> 00:03:20.930
I'm going to deploy
a bunch of stuff

00:03:20.930 --> 00:03:22.460
onto Google Cloud
Platform, but I

00:03:22.460 --> 00:03:24.860
want to ensure that
I have visibility

00:03:24.860 --> 00:03:26.450
into exactly what's
happening but then

00:03:26.450 --> 00:03:29.690
also be able to scan and
enforce certain security

00:03:29.690 --> 00:03:31.470
rules about what I
want to have happen.

00:03:31.470 --> 00:03:33.636
So say, for example, I want
to have certain firewall

00:03:33.636 --> 00:03:35.480
rules across, maybe,
my GCE instances

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:36.872
or other things like that.

00:03:36.872 --> 00:03:38.580
This gives me a way
to basically be like,

00:03:38.580 --> 00:03:41.052
OK, let's look at what's
available inside our system.

00:03:41.052 --> 00:03:43.260
Let's see if it has the
rules that are applied to it.

00:03:43.260 --> 00:03:44.634
And if they're
not applied to it,

00:03:44.634 --> 00:03:46.467
let's make sure that
those things are there

00:03:46.467 --> 00:03:48.050
and make sure that
that happens, which

00:03:48.050 --> 00:03:49.504
is security good and stuff.

00:03:49.504 --> 00:03:50.920
FRANCESC CAMPOY:
I really like it,

00:03:50.920 --> 00:03:54.830
because if you have enough
instances, these kind of things

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:56.060
will happen.

00:03:56.060 --> 00:03:57.080
Someone will forget.

00:03:57.080 --> 00:04:01.190
Someone will be doing a
little test and open SSH port

00:04:01.190 --> 00:04:02.280
and then forget about it.

00:04:02.280 --> 00:04:04.375
And then now you have
an attack vector.

00:04:04.375 --> 00:04:06.500
MARK MANDEL: Yeah, and even
if you're automating it

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:09.210
with Ansible or Chef or Puppet,
