is always locked down.

00:04:13.660 --> 00:04:15.770
FRANCESC CAMPOY: And it's
not only just warning,

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:20.000
but you can actually say, OK,
just drop that added rule.

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:20.860
Close that port.

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:21.589
