00:06:19.070 --> 00:06:21.710
We have customers with
thousands of repositories.

00:06:21.710 --> 00:06:23.850
We have users who
jump around 10,

00:06:23.850 --> 00:06:25.970
20, 30 open-source repositories.

00:06:25.970 --> 00:06:28.400
Our product makes that a
lot easier for you to read.

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:30.608
MARK MANDEL: So OK, so this
sounds quite interesting,

00:06:30.608 --> 00:06:31.780
